From 64560b671b656e1f34556e71dc1bd320df6081cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Kearney <303316+iconidentify@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 03:23:28 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] hk: add opt-in G15S split depth compression

Compress only the depth plane of single-sample D32_SFLOAT_S8_UINT
images on legacy G15S. Keep stencil uncompressed and preserve other
profiles. Limit the path to optimal 2D images with one layer and level.
Keep the default uncompressed and expose allocation and submit fields
through an optional trace.

Signed-off-by: Chris Kearney <303316+iconidentify@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 src/asahi/vulkan/hk_g15s_split_depth.h        | 25 ++++++++++
 src/asahi/vulkan/hk_image.c                   | 22 ++++++++-
 src/asahi/vulkan/hk_queue.c                   | 11 +++++
 src/asahi/vulkan/meson.build                  | 12 +++++
 .../vulkan/tests/test-hk-g15s-split-depth.c   | 46 +++++++++++++++++++
